1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,798
This is Dermalogica's Breakout Clearing Foaming Wash.

2
00:00:03,798 --> 00:00:07,441
Here's what's in it, and how Dermalogica says to use it.

3
00:00:08,141 --> 00:00:12,988
The active ingredient is salicylic acid, at zero point five percent.

4
00:00:12,988 --> 00:00:18,048
Dermalogica says it clears dead skin cells and trapped oils from pores.

5
00:00:18,748 --> 00:00:24,155
It also contains eight botanicals, including tea tree, lavender and camellia, plus

6
00:00:24,155 --> 00:00:25,474
orange peel extract.

7
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,797
Use it morning and night.

8
00:00:27,797 --> 00:00:33,027
Work a pea-sized amount into a lather in wet hands, massage it over your face, neck,

9
00:00:33,027 --> 00:00:37,386
chest or back, keep it away from your eyes, and rinse with warm water.

10
00:00:38,148 --> 00:00:42,902
If you have a known sensitivity to one of the ingredients, patch test first.

11
00:00:42,902 --> 00:00:47,031
And if your acne is severe or painful, see a doctor or pharmacist.

12
00:00:47,731 --> 00:00:50,235
We earn a commission if you buy through our link.

13
00:00:50,935 --> 00:00:53,759
Find it at acne medicine dot co dot za.
